{"id":"e_vidence","lemma":"évidence","pos":"noun","rank":2262,"glosses":["obviousness, clearness"],"ipa":"/e.vi.dɑ̃s/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f8/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-%C3%A9vidence.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-%C3%A9vidence.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"évidences"},"formAudio":{"évidences":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c9/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Mathieu_Kappler-%C3%A9vidences.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Mettez vos mains en évidence.","en":"Put your hands out.","words":[{"g":"to put","l":"mettre"},{"g":"your, belonging to you","l":"votre"},{"g":"hand","l":"main"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"J'ai seulement dit une évidence.","en":"I only stated the obvious.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"only"},{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"dire"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"C'est de toute évidence faux.","en":"This is obviously fake.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"all","l":"tout"},null,{"g":"false"}]},{"text":"N'assénez pas des évidences !","en":"Don't state the obvious.","words":[{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"À l'évidence, ça ne fonctionne pas.","en":"Obviously, it's not working.","words":[{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to function, to work","l":"fonctionner"},{"g":"not"}]}]}